DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260519T213000
UID:de9a02e6cb35a31116600811@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:You can either learn to meditate from scratch and develop the 
 foundations for a daily practice or join the regulars to build on what you
  know and discover how to apply Wisdom reflections in meditation.
