DESCRIPTION:In this series\, we will be exploring the essential teachings 
 of Buddhism. We will do this by way of talks\, discussion and workshops lo
 oking at the Three Jewels - Buddha\, Dharma\, Sangha\, and seeing how thes
 e can guide us in our lives today.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/daytime-buddhism-20-may
END:VEVENT
